p;-31</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Got rat trouble? Not for long! Hire Stompinn' Borzz the Ratcatcher and your troubles are over!\n</p><p><br>\nSmall rats, big rats, giant rats, rabid rats, any kind of rats, Borzz stomps them all! Reasonable rates, corpses and rat pellets removed at no extra charge.\n</p><p><br>\nReferences upon request.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202526\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1374/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23865/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5822/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935608/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.195      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   40.195      1 -total\n 49.39%   19.851      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.96%   17.668     15 Template:Trim\n 23.83%    9.578      2 Template:Uid\n 16.66%    6.696      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.31%    5.350      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.65%    4.279      1 Template:Notes\n  9.99%    4.015      1 Template:Icon_link\n  9.83%    3.950      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31351-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202526 and revision id 227948. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}